cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Krinea in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: Krinea
abstract: >-
  Open-source workbench for systematic reviews: import of search exports,
  duplicate detection, blind title/abstract and full-text screening with
  consensus, AI-assisted data extraction into author-defined forms with a
  verbatim quote per value, and the PRISMA 2020 flow diagram.
authors:
  - family-names: Plakoo
    given-names: Kodjovi Aymard
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/aymardino/krinea"
url: "https://krinea.org"
keywords:
  - systematic review
  - evidence synthesis
  - screening
  - data extraction
  - deduplication
  - PRISMA 2020
